                %em Large-N expansion as a semiclassical approximation to the third-quantized theory
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevD.60.105012"} doi
          %p
            The refinement for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/super+Yang-Mills+theory"} super Yang-Mills theory
            to the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/AdS%2FCFT+correspondence"} AdS/CFT correspondence
            (see there for more) originates with
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Juan+Maldacena"}> Juan Maldacena
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  The large
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
